{"symbol":"TOM.OL","area":"europe","updated":"2026-11-09T20:25:46Z","info":{"address1":"Drengsrudhagen 2","city":"Asker","zip":"1385","country":"Norway","phone":"47 66 79 91 00","website":"https://www.tomra.com","industry":"Waste Management","industryKey":"waste-management","industryDisp":"Waste Management","sector":"Industrials","sectorKey":"industrials","sectorDisp":"Industrials","longBusinessSummary":"Tomra Systems ASA provides sensor-based solutions for optimal resource productivity worldwide. It operates through four segments: TOMRA Collection, TOMRA Recycling, TOMRA Food, and TOMRA Horizon. The company provides reverse vending machines and related data management systems; and provides pick-up, transportation, and processing services of empty beverage containers on behalf of beverage producers/fillers. It also develops, produces, sale, and service sorting and processing technology for waste management companies or plant builders; and provides sorting systems for waste and metal material streams, as well as ore sorting sensors for mining companies. In addition, the company provides post-harvest food solutions for fresh and processed food industries. The company was founded in 1972 and is headquartered in Asker, Norway.","fullTimeEmployees":5800,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Tove  Andersen","age":55,"title":"President & CEO","yearBorn":1970,"fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":9214957,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Eva  Sagemo","age":50,"title":"Chief Financial Officer","yearBorn":1975,"fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":4339470,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Stefan  Schrahe","age":51,"title":"Executive Vice President of People & Organization","yearBorn":1974,"fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":5583375,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Harald  Henriksen","age":62,"title":"Executive VP & Head of Tomra Food","yearBorn":1963,"fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":9240991,"exercisedValue"